# Кожна MQTT-ідентичність має лише власні топіки.

user cold
topic write office/server/cold/status
topic write office/server/cold/telemetry

user hot
topic write office/server/hot/status
topic write office/server/hot/telemetry

user humidity
topic write office/server/humidity/status
topic write office/server/humidity/telemetry

user leak
topic write office/server/leak/status
topic write office/server/leak/telemetry

user door
topic write office/server/door/status
topic write office/server/door/telemetry

user ups
topic write office/server/ups/status
topic write office/server/ups/telemetry

user ac
topic write office/server/ac/status
topic read office/server/ac/set
topic write office/server/ac/state

user siren
topic write office/server/siren/status
topic read office/server/siren/set
topic write office/server/siren/state

user openhab
topic read office/server/+/telemetry
topic read office/server/+/state
topic read office/server/+/status
topic write office/server/ac/set
topic write office/server/siren/set

user admin
topic readwrite office/server/#
